+Register a callback to be called on LSP calls sent from the server -> client
+that aren't currently handled by Helix as a built in.
+
+```scheme
+(register-lsp-call-handler lsp-name event-name handler)
+```
+
+* lsp-name : string?
+* event-name : string?
